    "method": "10000 Monte Carlo demand paths per scenario drawn from P2 point forecasts and assumed planning ranges mapped to 5th/95th percentiles, with a shared event shock. P2 expected counts are treated as medians. Parking prepared for the planning quantile, staffing and fuel for P50 plus buffer. Impact compares normal plan vs prepared plan on the same paths. Variant: heavy rain (at least 0.5 in) on day index 3. Completed operations change by -6.3% (measured on LAX heavy-rain days vs comparable dry days, NOAA x FAA 2016-2019 and 2023-2025, weighted Part 91 -9.8% / Part 135 -4.1%); the missing arrivals and departures happen the next day. About 5% of February days at LAX have heavy rain.",
    "limitations": "P2 historical input provenance: estimated. FBO allocation, reservations and event assumptions are provisional; results are conditional simulations, not observed FBO performance. P2 event-week ranges are not validated against observed Super Bowl outcomes.",
